### 企业分类分区统计API测试

### 1. 获取部门树形结构
GET http://localhost:8080/jeecg-boot/energy/classification/getOrgTree
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. 获取能源类型列表
GET http://localhost:8080/jeecg-boot/energy/classification/getEnergyTypes
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. 查询分类分区统计汇总数据
POST http://localhost:8080/jeecg-boot/energy/classification/getSummaryData
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgCode": "A01",
  "energyType": "all",
  "timeDimension": "month",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01",
  "endDate": "2024-01-31",
  "includeChildren": true
}

###

### 4. 查询趋势对比数据
POST http://localhost:8080/jeecg-boot/energy/classification/getTrendData
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgCode": "A01",
  "energyType": "all",
  "timeDimension": "month",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01",
  "endDate": "2024-06-30",
  "includeChildren": true
}

###

### 5. 导出分类分区统计数据
GET http://localhost:8080/jeecg-boot/energy/classification/exportData?orgCode=A01&energyType=all&timeDimension=month&startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2024-01-31&includeChildren=true
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. 单独能源类型查询测试
POST http://localhost:8080/jeecg-boot/energy/classification/getSummaryData
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgCode": "A01",
  "energyType": "1",
  "timeDimension": "month",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01",
  "endDate": "2024-01-31",
  "includeChildren": true
}

###

### 7. 子部门查询测试
POST http://localhost:8080/jeecg-boot/energy/classification/getSummaryData
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgCode": "A",
  "energyType": "all",
  "timeDimension": "month",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01",
  "endDate": "2024-01-31",
  "includeChildren": true
}

###

### 8. 不同时间维度测试
POST http://localhost:8080/jeecg-boot/energy/classification/getSummaryData
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgCode": "A01",
  "energyType": "all",
  "timeDimension": "day",
  "startDate": "2024-01-01",
  "endDate": "2024-01-01",
  "includeChildren": true
}